@startuml
title View Statistics Dashboard Sequence (/api/progress/summary)

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Learner
boundary "Statistics Dashboard UI" as StatisticsDashboardUi
control "ProgressOverviewNotifier\n(FE Mobile)" as FeController
control "ProgressApiService\n(FE Mobile)" as FeApiService
entity "ProgressSummaryDto\n(FE Response DTO)" as FeSummaryDto
entity "ProgressSummaryResponse\n(BE Response DTO)" as BeSummaryDto
control "ProgressController\n(BE API)" as BeController
control "ProgressSummaryService" as SummaryService
entity "TestSession" as TestSessionEntity
entity "TestAnswer" as TestAnswerEntity
entity "UserWordProgress" as UserWordProgressEntity
control "ProgressSummaryRepository" as SummaryRepository
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL

note over StatisticsDashboardUi, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Mobile UI file exists: progress_overview_screen.dart.
FE controller/service exist: ProgressOverviewNotifier and ProgressApiService.
FE response DTO exists: ProgressSummaryDto.
BE controller exists: ProgressController.
BE response DTO exists: ProgressSummaryResponse.
Endpoint is GET /api/progress/summary; no request DTO body is used.
Entities exist: TestSession, TestAnswer and UserWordProgress.
end note

Learner -> StatisticsDashboardUi: Open statistics dashboard
StatisticsDashboardUi -> FeController: load()
FeController -> FeApiService: getSummary()
FeApiService -> BeController: GET /api/progress/summary
BeController -> BeController: Check authenticated user

alt User id missing
    BeController --> FeApiService: HTTP 401 error
    FeApiService --> FeController: Action failed
    FeController --> StatisticsDashboardUi: Show error state
else User authenticated
    BeController -> SummaryService: GetSummaryAsync(userId)
    SummaryService -> SummaryService: Build seven-day and month query
    SummaryService -> SummaryRepository: GetSummaryStatisticsAsync(userId, query)
    SummaryRepository -> DbContext: Query session dates
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT test_sessions
    MySQL --> DbContext: Session date rows
    DbContext -> TestSessionEntity: Read TestSession dates
    TestSessionEntity --> DbContext: Session dates

    SummaryRepository -> DbContext: Query answer accuracy
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT test_answers\nJOIN test_sessions
    MySQL --> DbContext: Answer statistic rows
    DbContext -> TestAnswerEntity: Read TestAnswer rows
    DbContext -> TestSessionEntity: Read TestSession rows
    TestAnswerEntity --> DbContext: Correct and total counts
    TestSessionEntity --> DbContext: Seven-day scope

    SummaryRepository -> DbContext: Query progress counts
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT user_word_progresses
    MySQL --> DbContext: Progress rows
    DbContext -> UserWordProgressEntity: Read UserWordProgress rows
    UserWordProgressEntity --> DbContext: Words in progress\nand mastered words

    SummaryRepository -> DbContext: Query sessions this month
    DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT test_sessions
    MySQL --> DbContext: Monthly session rows
    DbContext -> TestSessionEntity: Read TestSession rows
    TestSessionEntity --> DbContext: Monthly session count

    DbContext --> SummaryRepository: Summary statistics
    SummaryRepository --> SummaryService: Summary statistics
    SummaryService -> SummaryService: Calculate streaks\nand accuracy
    SummaryService --> BeController: Summary result
    BeController -> BeSummaryDto: Create ProgressSummaryResponse
    BeSummaryDto --> BeController: ProgressSummaryResponse
    BeController --> FeApiService: HTTP 200 OK\nProgressSummaryResponse
    FeApiService -> FeSummaryDto: Parse response data
    FeSummaryDto --> FeApiService: ProgressSummary
    FeApiService --> FeController: Progress summary
    FeController --> StatisticsDashboardUi: Show statistics cards
end

@enduml
